  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving the aquaculture sector in Egypt</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this project is to strengthen food safety and regulatory oversight throughout the Egyptian aquaculture value chain, ensuring closer alignment with European and international standards.The project will conduct a comprehensive context analysis to identify the systemic challenges, governance gaps, and key actors influencing food safety and oversight in the sector.Parallel to the analysis, the project will engage with principal stakeholders to explore the establishment of a multi-stakeholder steering committee. This body would serve as a platform to coordinate efforts, set priorities, and define a roadmap of actionable steps to improve food safety and compliance in the aquaculture sector in Egypt.</narrative>
  </description>
